   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,439:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Apache Kafka, Apache Flink
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,440:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1.3 Evolution of Data Science
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,441:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Era | What Happened |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,441:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,442:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | :--- | :--- |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,443:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,443:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,444:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1960s–70s
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,453:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Statistics and early computing. Data stored in flat files. |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,454:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,455:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,455:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1980s
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,457:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,458:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Relational databases invented (SQL). Data became queryable. |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,460:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1990s
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,462:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Data Mining emerged — finding patterns in
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,462:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: databases. Data warehousing. |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,463:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,463:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,463:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 2000s
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,464:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Big Data era — Hadoop, distributed computing. Google
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,465:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,465:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s MapReduce paper
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,466:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: (2004). |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,466:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,467:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,467:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 2010s
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,468:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Machine Learning 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,468:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,469:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Deep Learning boom. Scikit-learn, TensorFlow. |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,469:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,470:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,470:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 2020s
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,473:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | AI, Large
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,474:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Language Models (GPT), AutoML, real-time analytics. Democratization of data science. |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,475:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1.4 Data Science Lifecycle
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,476:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: This is the step-by-step process every data science project follows:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,477:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1. Problem Definition
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,478:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:        ↓
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,488:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 2. Data Collection
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,488:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:        ↓
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,489:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 3. Data Cleaning
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,490:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:        ↓
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,490:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,491:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:        ↓
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,491:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 5. Feature Engineering
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,492:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:        ↓
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,493:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 6. Model Building
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,493:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:        ↓
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,494:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 7. Model Evaluation
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,494:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:        ↓
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,495:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 8. Deployment & Monitoring
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,496:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Each Phase Explained:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,497:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1. Problem Definition
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,497:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,498:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Define WHAT you want to solve. Be specific.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,499:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,499:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ❌ Bad: 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,510:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,510:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Improve sales.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,511:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,512:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  ✅ Good: 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,512:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,513:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Predict which customers will churn in the next 30 days.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,514:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,514:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 2. Data Collection
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,515:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,516:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gather data from databases, APIs, surveys, web scraping, sensors.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,516:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,517:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Sources: CSV files, SQL databases, REST APIs, IoT devices.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,518:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 3. Data Cleaning
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,519:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,519:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Real data is MESSY. You
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,520:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,521:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ll spend 60-80% of time here.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,522:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,523:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Tasks: Handle missing values, remove duplicates, fix typos, standardize formats.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,524:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,524:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,525:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Understand relationships and patterns using statistics and plots.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,526:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,527:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Compute mean, median, mode. Draw histograms, boxplots, scatter plots.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,528:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 5. Feature Engineering
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,528:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,529:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Create new useful columns from existing data.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,530:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,530:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Example: From 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,531:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Joining_Date
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,532:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , create 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,533:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Tenure_Years = Today − Joining_Date
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,542:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,543:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 6. Model Building
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,544:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,545:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Choose and train ML algorithms: Linear Regression, Decision Tree, k-NN, K-Means, etc.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,545:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,546:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Split data: 80% training, 20% testing.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,547:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 7. Model Evaluation
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,548:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,549:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Check how good the model is using metrics: Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-Score, RMSE.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,549:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 8. Deployment 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,550:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,550:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Monitoring
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,551:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,552:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Put the model into production (as an API, dashboard, or app).
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,552:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,553:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Monitor for data drift — is the model still accurate over time?
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,554:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1.5 Data Mining
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,555:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Data Mining
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,556:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  = The process of discovering hidden patterns and useful knowledge from large datasets.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,556:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Two Types:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,557:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Type | What it does | Question it answers | Techniques | Example |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,558:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,558:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
