   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,559:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,560:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Descriptive
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,561:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,561:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Summarizes past data | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,562:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,562:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: What happened?
