   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,569:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Predicts future outcomes | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,570:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
