   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,575:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: How they work together:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,576:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Descriptive mining finds patterns → Predictive mining uses those patterns to forecast.
