   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,655:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Questionnaires to people |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,656:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Google Forms feedback survey | Direct, specific | Small sample, response bias |
