   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,663:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | One-on-one
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,664:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: conversations | Interviewing patients for medical study | Deep insights | Time-consuming, not scalable |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,665:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,666:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,666:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Observation
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,667:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Watching 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,667:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,668:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  recording | Counting footfall in a mall | Authentic behavior | Observer bias |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,669:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,669:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,669:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Experiments
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,671:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Controlled tests | A/B testing a website button | Causal conclusions | Expensive, ethical concerns |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,671:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,671:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,672:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Web Scraping
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,675:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Extracting data from websites | Scraping prices from Flipkart | Large-scale, automated | Legal
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,675:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: issues, site structure changes |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,676:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,676:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,677:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: APIs
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,679:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Programmatic data access | Twitter API for tweets | Structured, reliable | Rate
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,679:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: limits, authentication |
