   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,684:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Pre-collected datasets | Census data, Kaggle datasets | Free, readily available
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,685:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | May not fit your exact need |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,685:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,686:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,686:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Sensors/IoT
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,689:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Automated from devices | Weather stations, fitness bands |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,690:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Continuous, real-time | Hardware costs, noise |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,691:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Primary vs Secondary Data:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,692:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | | Primary Data | Secondary Data |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-04 01:02:32,692:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
